      "content": "SCHEDULE   1. 967                                                               BLUCHER STREET                                                           No 1 SP 9501 NE 2/218 II 2. C16 or C17, refronted C19.  Red brick facing to timber framing visible on west side elevation.  Machine tiled roof.  2 storeys, C19 shop front, 2 C19 first floor sash windows.  Yard at rear with exposed timber framed buildings, partly weatherboarded and with part oversailing. Listing NGR: SP9592901769"
    }
